<p>This is a major rewrite of my own 2897 that I posted last month (January 11th). Due to the extent of the changes that have been made, and the amount of time that has elapsed since the original version was posted, I have chosen to delete the old version and post the written version in its slot. The discussion pages for the previous version have been attached as PDFs in 2897's files, and the page source for the previous version is included below.</p>
<p>Crit credit for this rewrite goes to Petrograd, Cimmerian, Aiden Eldritch, TyGently, and A Random Day.</p>
<p>The header image is my own work, and incorporates the SCP logo (created by far2), and the Department of Analytics logo (created by me, GreenWolf). The fonts used are <a href="https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Baumans">Baumans</a>, <a href="https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Abel">Abel</a>, and <a href="https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Dosis">Dosis</a>. All images are licensed under CC-BY-SA 3.0, and all fonts are licensed under the Open Font License.</p>
